From 954bfad79073f6a9f9dd08e41db6a86f638fcdc8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 00:15:46 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] fix(desktop): model pill + effort menu use the chat's stored
 model while its agent is unloaded [daveey]

A resumed chat with no live agent has no SessionView model. The composer
pill rendered only a braille spinner (read as a grip icon) and the effort
menu fell back to model.options' current, i.e. the PROFILE default, so a
Claude chat offered GPT's Thinking/Fast/Ultrafast (t_b319a52a).

- Session list rows project the stored route's provider (model_provider,
  via SessionDB.session_gateway_runtime) before model_config is stripped.
- useStoredModelSelection(view): the chat's stored model/provider from its
  sessions row.
- ModelPill: no live model + stored model -> stored label with a pulse and
  a 'loading this chat's model' tooltip. Bare spinner only for a draft and
  only for 5s; then 'Switch model'.
- currentPickerSelection prefers the stored route over the catalog current
  and never borrows the default's provider for a stored model.
- tui_gateway: _fallback_session_info for an unbuilt session reports its
  restored model_override instead of the profile default.
---
